    "campaign": {
      "revision": "VN-journey-v1",
      "instructions": "Generate ONE square finished ad card, exact reviewed Vietnamese headline/body/labels/CTA. Bright white/pale blue/navy tactile family; large readable headline and body at332px display. Logo once at upper left, reviewed category legible but compact. Main text occupies upper55 percent; distinct physical editorial scene below, no dark panel. Body minimum50px equivalent on1254 square. If CTA present, make separate readable flat orange/blue text action near lower edge and keep body equally readable. Only approved wording; no page numbers, extra labels, fake UI, screens, seals, customer marks, faces, wafers, chip trays, fab/cleanroom skyline, graph numbers or certification cues. The scene must differ meaningfully by card and illustrate process/data preparation, not verified customer facility. Never print caption/native headline/alt or internal reviewer observations. Do not repeat Cold numerical hook or leadership wording on these new cards."
    }
